# Version control

Full SOP: [docs/sop/version-control.md](docs/sop/version-control.md). PR closing: [github-prs skill](.cursor/skills/github-prs/SKILL.md).

## Semver

- **MAJOR** — breaking contracts / rewrite
- **MINOR** — backward-compatible features (`release/vX.Y.0`)
- **PATCH** — bugs/docs/polish (`release/vX.Y.Z`)
- Keep root `package.json` and README **Version:** in sync
- Bump `services/api` version only when API behavior/contract changes

## Branches & labels

- Work on `release/vX.Y.Z` matching the version being shipped
- Label issues/PRs with `vX.Y.Z`
- Merge to `main` via PR only; no force-push to shared branches

## Issues & PRs

- Close finished issues **only** with PR body `Closes #N` (never `gh issue close` for PR work)
- Release PRs: Summary, Test plan, and a complete **Closes** section
